---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import ContactForm from '../components/ContactForm.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="About Cheming.Site and its author, and how to get in touch.">
  <article class="page">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>Hello! I’m a physical chemist by education and a chemical engineer by career. Over many projects, I built a set of tools that made me a faster and better process engineer. Now I’m sharing them with fellow engineers.</p>
    <p>Today, Cheming.Site is free to use. It needs no account and collects no data, and everything runs in your browser. As the site grows, I plan to add professional features and extra services for engineers and companies who need more. The tools you use today will stay available.</p>
    <p>I’d love your input. Tell me what works, what’s missing, and what you would pay for. I’m also open to partnerships and collaboration. Feel free to get in touch.</p>

    <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
    <p>Comments, feature requests, error reports and offers are welcome. Write below, or reach me directly:</p>
    <ul class="links">
      <li set:html={`<a href="${site.mailtoEncoded}">Email</a>`} />
      {site.social.map((s) => <li><a href={s.url} rel="noopener">{s.label}</a></li>)}
    </ul>
    <ContactForm />
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .page { max-width: 42rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2.5rem var(--gutter) 0; }
  h1 { margin: 0 0 1rem; font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: -0.015em; }
  h2 { margin: 2.5rem 0 0.5rem; padding-bottom: 0.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink); font: 400 0.9375rem/1 var(--font-drawing); letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; scroll-margin-top: calc(var(--header-h) + 1rem); }
  p { margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  .links { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem 1.5rem; }
</style>
